            "\\(80\\text{ cm}^2\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "Area of a parallelogram \\(=\\text{base}\\times\\text{height}\\).",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Use the formula for the area of a parallelogram.",
              "work": "\\(\\text{Area}=\\text{base}\\times\\text{height}\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Substitute the base (8 cm) and the perpendicular height (5 cm).",
